      "uid": "zhcn:1166158627c0658ee8794f04",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在此时，<chrname>收到索侬艾尔菲的邀请，\n参与到宣传视频的制作中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05a6dd6a98a035d5b38f1b8e8dffff3ea20d8d51813e91e54c9b97fee998d046",
