    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe72f7c23df20b758d8bf845",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在赛跑之外的运动项目中，赛马娘也能闪耀。\n为了向世界展示这一点——\n她投入了大量精力进行宣传。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a58d22772dcbd5e2b7edc4e68f54418fd6e492f315d01ea6b0bdd1051d7d411",
