      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在视频中，<chrname>\n与索侬艾尔菲在15种竞技中对决。\n<chrname>被她压倒性的体能远远甩在后面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39bde954bdc7214d113ab605b0b67238d0a40f1e8083b07d37d580e3c1561057",
