      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "结合发现的改进点加强训练，\n为了『U.A.F.』的成功而努力\n——我们重新振作起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5375303fa6c277ef3d603ac7e89e92a74b3c705a24fa7831be682ed2abb1aee5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
