      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所有参赛选手都感到充实，\n已经为明年的正式比赛燃起了斗志。\n当然，<chrname>也一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "502abb514e9ab5405bf2551d320042cf3f6380d48e30437596118d6415757781",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
