      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要想让大众热情高涨，还有不足之处。\n为了吸引新受众，都留岐凉花开始思考。",
      "source_fingerprint": "690f49a13d29341bd89185b4c7c77ecd3a34d2f1296c230a2603fcb1cccca229",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
